    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1076">

                <pb facs="1260" n="1064" xml:id="pg1064"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.00/7–2245</note>
                <head>No. 1076<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by Prime Minister
                        Churchill</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1076-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1076-f2"/>]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">P. (<hi rendition="#small-caps">Terminal</hi>)
                        25</seg>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Greece</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum by Mr.
                    Churchill</hi></p>
                <p>In view of the reference to Greece in the Soviet Memorandum,<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d1076-f3"/> I circulate the following two papers to the Conference.
                    The first<anchor n="*" xml:id="d1076-f4"/> is the report of Field Marshal
                    Alexander.…</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed> W[<hi rendition="#small-caps">inston</hi>] S. C[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">hurchill</hi>] </signed>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Potsdam</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-22">22nd July,
                            1945</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1076-a1.xml" xpointer="d1076-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1076-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d1076-f1-content">
                <p>Printed from the mimeographed text circulated at the Sixth Meeting of the Foreign
                    Ministers, July 23. See <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg287"
                        >p. 287</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1076-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1076-f2-content">
                <p>For the full text of this memorandum, see <ref target="#d1066">document No.
                        1066</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1076-f3" n="3" xml:id="d1076-f3-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d1073">document No. 1073</ref>.</p>
            </note>
